  "details": "The notifications on the website seem to be limited to 100. If i make a call to the API i can see that i have 115 open notifications though. (important: i need to use paging in order to see the missing 15)\n\nIf i click \"view more\" i can only see the last 100 notifications. Clicking on \"Load More\" makes an API call with the option \"hidden=true\" - which results in the API only returning the first 21 entries. I am unable to view the other notifications without using the API.\n\nIt seems like the website is making a HTTP request with \"hidden=true\" on the \"Load more\" call which it should not do, since the view is supposed to show every notification (i guesss?)",
